# Raw reel downloads — run `npm run media` to process them into public/videos/
media-src/

# NOT ignored: public/videos/ is committed.
#
# It is generated by `npm run media` from assets/reels/, so ignoring it looks
# right — but the site is deployed by building this repository, and the build
# does not run ffmpeg. Ignored, a deploy comes up with every reel missing and
# every card silently fallen back to its gradient. The ~12 MB is the price of
# the deploy being reproducible from a clone.

# Raw logo drops — run `npm run logos` to normalise them into public/logos/
logo-src/
